## What to do if you simply forgot or were offline
If you missed the trade because your battery died, you lost internet connection, or you fell asleep, do not panic yet.
Log into your app right now:

* If the order is still "In Appeal," click "Payment Received" immediately to release it yourself. This protects your account from being banned.
* If the platform has already force-released it, your account might already be restricted. You will need to contact customer support to explain that it was an honest mistake due to a connectivity issue, though unbanning a P2P account can be very difficult.

